{"id":"74438714e304bba9","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-clause.md","title":"Boolean clause","display":"df-clause — Boolean clause","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-clause","aliases":["27-df-clause"],"display":"df-clause — Boolean clause","depends_on":["[[27-df-literal]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.4 Definition 1.10","source_printed_pages":"15","source_pdf_pages":"39","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-clause"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-clause</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-clause — Boolean clause"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.4 Definition 1.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\)</span>；文字及一致文字集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_L\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,1-\\prod_{\\ell\\in L}(1-\\ell(a))\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\},\\qquad\\prod_{\\ell\\in\\emptyset}(1-\\ell(a))\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_L\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,1-\\prod_{\\ell\\in L}(1-\\ell(a))\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\},\\qquad\\prod_{\\ell\\in\\emptyset}(1-\\ell(a))\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\coloneqq\\{C_L\\mid L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{CLits}(C_L)\\coloneqq L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\coloneqq\\{C_L\\mid L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{CLits}(C_L)\\coloneqq L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 elementary disjunction 也要求正、负指标集不交。修复原定义允许互补对而把不同文字集压成同一个恒真函数的问题；现在 CLits 单值。空子句为常 0；恒真 CNF 用空子句集表示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$；文字及一致文字集见 [[27-df-literal]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n","display":false},{"tex":"C_L\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,1-\\prod_{\\ell\\in L}(1-\\ell(a))\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\},\\qquad\\prod_{\\ell\\in\\emptyset}(1-\\ell(a))\\coloneqq1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\coloneqq\\{C_L\\mid L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{CLits}(C_L)\\coloneqq L.","display":true}],"bytes":1236,"backlinks":[{"id":"775e79fda1f79171","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；文字、项、子句、真假点见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-truefalse]]。"},{"id":"99daa28c1863bae0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$C_L,C_M\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n$，$L=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_L)$，$M=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_M)$；见 [[27-df-clause]]。$\\downarrow$ 表示部分函数有定义。"},{"id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Clause}_n$ 见 [[27-df-clause]]；$C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_n$，$a\\in\\mathbb B^n$。"},{"id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$；见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]、[[27-df-boolexpr]]。字串以 $[r]$ 为定义域的函数编码；字串连接、有限列连接及字典序排序在 Assertion 中构造。$E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$；$\\iota$ 表示满足给定条件的唯一对象。表面表达式的叶子和连接构造均采用 [[27-df-boolexpr]] 的有限树语法。"},{"id":"7325f859473bf017","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Clause}_n$ and its uniquely indexed clauses $C_L$ are as in [[27-df-clause]]."},{"id":"7c550fd5ce4d17c6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$，$\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)$；子句和文字补见 [[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-literal]]。$E_C$ 与 $\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)$ 由下式构造；$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}$ 是 $\\mathrm{Lit}_n$ 上的二元谓词，路径采用指标集 $\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}$。"},{"id":"e7d22e6414925057","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；子句及 $\\mathrm{CLits}$ 见 [[27-df-clause]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-clause|df-clause — Boolean clause]]"},{"id":"8c0a6e3c38dda0eb","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；规范形式见 [[27-df-canonicalforms]]，求值见 [[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{CLits}$ 见 [[27-df-clause]]。"},{"id":"f47e52113c1c33ee","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_L$、$\\mathrm{Lits}$、$C_L$、$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dual]]。"},{"id":"fc6ee0d11ecfb0f6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$、$T_L$、$\\mathrm{CLits}$、$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-hornclause]]、[[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dual]]。"},{"id":"698a77a0557fd7dc","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]；$\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n$, $T_L$, $C_L$ and $\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-shellable]], [[27-df-term]], [[27-df-clause]] and [[27-df-dual]]."}],"outgoing":["99c92f3457aacd12"]}